note SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
note gpu/nvidia/checks/nmm-next.om: stand-in for gpu/nvidia/om/api/mm_next.om in the check nmm; see nmm-init.om.
fn mm_next q edit ulong 8 to bool
put q 1 add get q 1 1
if eq get q 1 get q 3
put q 1 0
put q 0 add get q 0 1
end
put q 5 add mul get q 0 get q 3 get q 1
ret lt get q 0 get q 4
end
